	and \[\b{E}_S[\mathbbm{1}_{i,j\in S}] = \mathcal{O}(\tfrac{k^2}{m^2})\], we can upper-bound \[\clubsuit_1:=\|\b{E}_S[\b{A}^*_S \b{A}^{*^\top}_S] \| \] as 
	\begin{align*}
	\clubsuit_1:= \|\b{E}_S[\b{A}^*_S \b{A}^{*^\top}_S] \| 
	= \mathcal{O}(\tfrac{k^2}{m^2})\|\b{A}^* \b{1}^{m \times m} \b{A}^{*^\top}\| =  \mathcal{O}(\tfrac{k^2}{m})\|\b{A}^*\|^2,
