	where \[\b{1}^{m \times m} \] denotes an \[m \times m\] matrix of ones.

Now, we turn to \[\clubsuit_2:=\|\b{E}_S[\b{A}^*_S (\b{I} - \Lambda^{(t)}_S)\b{A}^{(t)^\top}_S] \|\] in  \eqref{iht:mat_W_var_term_1}, which can be simplified as
