Similarly, \[\clubsuit_3 \] \eqref{iht:mat_W_var_term_1} is also \[\mathcal{O}(\tfrac{k^2}{m})\|\b{A}^*\|^2\]. Next, we consider \[\clubsuit_4:= \|\b{E}_S[\b{A}^{(t)}_S(\b{I} - \Lambda^{(t)}_S)^2\b{A}^{(t)^\top}_S]\|  \] in \eqref{iht:mat_W_var_term_1} which can also be bounded similarly as
