Consider \[\spadesuit\]  in \eqref{iht:mat_W_var}. Letting \[\b{M} = \b{E}_{\b{x}^*_S}[\vartheta^{(R)}_S\b{x}^{*^\top}_S|S]\], and using the analysis similar to that shown in \ref{iht:bound_vareps}, we have that elements of  \[\b{M} \in \mathbb{R}^{k \times k}\] are given by
