Similarly, \[\heartsuit\] in \eqref{iht:mat_W_var} is also bounded as \[\spadesuit\]. Next, we consider \[\diamondsuit\] in \eqref{iht:mat_W_var}. In this case, letting \[\b{E}_{\b{x}^*_S}[\vartheta^{(R)}_S(\vartheta^{(R)}_S)^\top|S] = \b{N}\], where \[\b{N} \in \mathbb{R}^{k \times k}\] is a matrix whose each entry \[\b{N}_{i,j} \leq |\vartheta^{(R)}_i||\vartheta^{(R)}_j|\]. Further, by Claim~\ref{iht:var_theta_abs}, each element \[\vartheta^{(R)}_{j}\] is upper-bounded as 






